Okay.

1618
01:23:01,616 --> 01:23:03,250
What do we got?

1619
01:23:04,853 --> 01:23:08,021
So it turns out Dennis Bell
and Henry King haven't been

1620
01:23:08,055 --> 01:23:09,657
seen for days.

1621
01:23:09,691 --> 01:23:12,459
So that's 2 people who used
to hang around his garage,

1622
01:23:12,493 --> 01:23:15,897
neighbor girl, these 4 other
people, and a little girl

1623
01:23:15,930 --> 01:23:17,231
outside Sumter.

1624
01:23:17,264 --> 01:23:20,535
If he has a problem
with someone, they disappear.

1625
01:23:20,568 --> 01:23:22,102
Seems like it.

1626
01:23:22,135 --> 01:23:23,370
[phone ringing]

1627
