Detective Ainsley.

1628
01:23:26,941 --> 01:23:28,008
Uh-huh.

1629
01:23:29,577 --> 01:23:30,344
Okay.

1630
01:23:31,679 --> 01:23:33,113
Yeah, he's with me.

1631
01:23:33,882 --> 01:23:36,016
Uh, McNeil?

1632
01:23:36,718 --> 01:23:37,585
Now?

1633
01:23:39,052 --> 01:23:40,120
We'll be right down.

1634
01:23:40,989 --> 01:23:42,222
Let's go.

1635
01:23:42,256 --> 01:23:44,191
Walter McNeil wants to talk.

1636
01:23:44,224 --> 01:23:45,259
