1658
01:25:30,364 --> 01:25:31,264
Norma?

1659
01:25:32,332 --> 01:25:34,869
Yeah, it's me, Pee Wee.

1660
01:25:34,902 --> 01:25:37,038
Listen, baby, I

1661
01:25:37,071 --> 01:25:38,606
might have to go away
for a while.

1662
01:25:39,406 --> 01:25:40,908
Yeah, I gotta get out of town

1663
01:25:40,942 --> 01:25:43,143
