1668
01:25:51,919 --> 01:25:52,820
Out of the phone booth!

1669
01:25:52,854 --> 01:25:54,022
Call you back, baby.

1670
01:25:54,055 --> 01:25:55,023
On the ground,

1671
01:25:55,056 --> 01:25:57,157
Now!

1672
01:25:57,190 --> 01:26:00,427
Out of the phone booth,
get on the ground, now!

1673
01:26:01,194 --> 01:26:02,630
Come on, come on!

1674
01:26:02,664 --> 01:26:04,264
Easy, easy.

1675
01:26:07,101 --> 01:26:09,469
Hands behind your back.

1676
01:26:09,503 --> 01:26:13,508
Donald Henry Gaskins, you're
under arrest for contributing

1677
01:26:13,541 --> 01:26:15,409
