1678
01:26:15,442 --> 01:26:17,277
You have the right
to remain silent.

1679
01:26:17,879 --> 01:26:19,013
[car door shuts]

1680
01:26:19,047 --> 01:26:20,715
[dramatic music plays]

1681
01:26:20,748 --> 01:26:21,783
Come on, Walter.

1682
01:26:22,315 --> 01:26:23,117
[shovel sounds]

1683
01:26:23,151 --> 01:26:25,252
