1684
01:26:26,954 --> 01:26:28,523
[flies buzzing]

1685
01:26:28,790 --> 01:26:29,624
Uhh.

1686
01:26:35,697 --> 01:26:36,496
That's Henry.

1687
01:26:37,965 --> 01:26:39,433
My God, how do you know?

1688
01:26:40,702 --> 01:26:42,235
Recognize the shirt.

1689
01:26:44,438 --> 01:26:46,708
Must be that burial ground
he was telling you about.

1690
01:26:50,778 --> 01:26:51,979
Oh God!

1691
